# Language — English only

Write **documentation** and **code comments** in English.

## In scope

- `README.md`, `SKILL.md` body, `agents/*.md`, `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`
- JSON Schema `description` fields, asset `doc` strings
- Script headers, inline comments, CLI help text, error messages in scripts
- Commit messages follow the separate Russian Conventional Commits rule when the user asks for commits

## Out of scope

- Chat replies to the user (follow the user's language preference)
- Russian trigger phrases inside a skill's YAML `description` frontmatter (agent discovery only — see `skills.mdc`)

## Examples

```markdown
<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
Skills are compatible with ide-agents: nested layout under `skills/`.

<!-- ❌ BAD -->
Скиллы совместимы с ide-agents: nested layout под `skills/`.
```

```javascript
// ✅ GOOD — stamp catalog provenance on every artifact
generatedBy: GENERATED_BY,

// ❌ BAD
// URL каталога скиллов
```
